  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "A mortal Pulling Water Gu looks like a mosquito larva. It is thin and brown with a little green inside, wide and big, and its body retracts and expands as it floats. Pulling water Gu emits a mysterious power that lets a Gu Master manipulate water currents like rivers and streams, and the mortal Pulling Water Gu’s effect is far below the rank six Immortal Gu. Fang Yuan refines this mortal Gu, and because Immortal Gu are unique, a great number of mortal Pulling Water Gu can temporarily replace the Immortal Gu in a killer move, as when two immortal killer moves need it at the same time. Pulling water Gu is a strength path Gu worm and is also related to water path.",
        "chapters": [
          1248
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "mortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master",
          "sys_mortal_gu",
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Under Pulling Water, Fang Yuan can move Reverse Flow River like other rivers and streams, but at rank six the movement is slow and cannot serve as an escape by itself. With perseverance Immortal Gu securing the river’s compliance, Pulling Water is one basis of an immortal killer move built around that river.",
        "chapters": [
          1287
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "river-applications",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_reverse_flow_river",
          "gu_perseverance_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At contact heart river bank Fang Yuan activates rank six strength path Immortal Gu Pulling Water and moves river water into his immortal aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          1590
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "river-applications",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In this life Fang Yuan uses Pulling Water at contact heart river bank while it is rank six, as it was in the previous life, and pulls the river water into his immortal aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          1770
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "river-applications",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
